.Dd October 8, 2026
.Dt MANET-POWER-STATUS.SH 8
.Os MANET
.Sh NAME
.Nm manet-power-status.sh
.Nd report Raspberry Pi under-voltage and throttling
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl -json
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
reads
.Li vcgencmd get_throttled
and reports current and since-boot under-voltage, CPU frequency capping,
throttling and soft temperature-limit flags.
The default output is a human-readable summary, also used at SSH login.
State labels are
.Li ok , notice , warning
and
.Li critical .
.Pp
If the mailbox command is absent or unavailable, human-readable output
is empty.
This does not establish that the power supply is healthy.
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl -json
Print JSON with availability, raw bitmask, state and individual flags.
Unavailable hardware produces
.Li {"available": false} .
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
Exits 0 for a status report, including under-voltage or unavailable hardware.
Invalid arguments return 1.
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bd -literal -offset indent
manet-power-status.sh --json
.Ed
